@startuml AnySpark v4 - Sequence: Exploration Flow
!theme plain
title AnySpark v4 — 顺序图：探索-判别双循环（Exploration Flow）
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor User
participant "routes_explore\n/routes_explore" as API
participant "IntentUnderstander\n/explore.intent" as Intent
participant "ExplorationEngine\n/explore.explorers" as Engine
participant "ExplorationStrategy\n/explore.strategy" as Strategy
participant "Model (LLM)" as LLM
participant "ProjectArchive\n/explore.direction" as Archive

== 阶段 1：意图理解 ==
User -> API: POST /api/explore/intent\n{seed}
API -> Intent: understand(seed)
Intent -> LLM: respond(INTENT_PROMPT + seed)
LLM --> Intent: JSON{concept, questions}
Intent --> API: concept_card
API -> Intent: build_confirmation(concept)
Intent --> API: confirmation_text
API --> User: 对齐确认（概念卡 + 歧义问题）

User -> API: POST /api/explore/intent
{seed}
API -> Intent: understand(seed)
Intent -> LLM: respond(INTENT_PROMPT + seed)
LLM --> Intent: JSON{concept, questions}
Intent --> API: concept_card
API -> Intent: build_confirmation(concept)
Intent --> API: confirmation_text
API --> User: 对齐确认（概念卡 + 歧义问题）

User -> API: POST /api/explore/cards
{seed, intent_confirmed}（S128：确认后直接取卡）

== 阶段 2：并行探索 ==
API -> Engine: run_exploration(model, seed, confirmed, constraints, templates)
API -> Strategy: ExplorationStrategy(seed, confirmed, constraints)

loop 4 个探索者并行（asyncio.gather）
  API -> Strategy: explorer_prompt(i)
  Strategy --> API: 差异化指令\n（维度 + 来源分派 template/grow/user）
  API -> LLM: respond(prompt_i, [])
  note right: 上下文隔离\n保证真多样性
  LLM --> API: JSON{title, summary, term}
  API -> Strategy: card_from_response(i, raw)
  Strategy --> API: DirectionCard
end

API --> User: 4 张方向卡（候选堆）

== 阶段 3：判别固化 ==
User -> API: POST /api/explore/archive\n{card, parent_node_id?}（S128 取代原 select）
API -> Archive: archive_direction(card, book_id)
Archive --> API: saved_direction
API -> Archive: add_constraint(content)
API -> StoryTree: add_node(主线节点, chosen=true)（S59：探索=树的生长器）
API --> User: 已固化方向 + 约束 + 叙事树节点

@enduml
